OL,3,GNEWSAHen and stag party noise concerns
OL,4,Aover holiday cabin plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for holiday cabins to be built
OL,7,Fnear a Welsh market town have led to
OL,8,Fnoise concerns, with fears the
OL,9,Faccommodation could attract hen and
OL,10,Fstag parties to the area.
OL,12,FEarlier this year, Tyler Richards from
OL,13,FKidderminster in Worcestershire
OL,14,Fsubmitted a planning application to
OL,15,FPowys council for four holiday cabins
OL,16,Fon land south of Bwlch-y-Ffridd, near
OL,17,FNewtown, Powys.
OL,19,FThe application will go before its
OL,20,Fplanning committee for a decision on 3
OL,21,FSeptember.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
