OL,3,GNEWSAHen and stag party noise concerns
OL,4,Aover holiday cabin plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut members of Aberhafesp community
OL,7,Fcouncil said they had "great concerns"
OL,8,Fover noise and have asked, if the
OL,9,Fapplication was granted, for conditions
OL,10,Fto be attached to "prevent group
OL,11,Fbookings".
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
